  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Remote Adjudication Interview Support to Permanent Resident Applicants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM supports the High Commission of Canada in Singapore / IRCC Singapore in organizing remote interviews for Cambodia Applicants for Permanent Residence in Canada as Members of the Family Class or Family Members. The objective of the project is for applicants in Cambodia to continue to benefit from access to permanent residency visas for Canada despite the pandemic restrictions. The main project outcome is that the Government of Canada expedites processing of applications for permanent residence visas for Canada through virtual interviews in Cambodia with support of IOM. This support will include access to hold interviews which will be conducted by IRCC Singapore in IOM premises and provision of technical assistance during the interviews, including establishing video connections through high-speed internet, technical equipment necessary to conduct the interviews and interview rooms. IOM will ensure this process follows public health guidance on preventing the spread of COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
